    LLM: '1. Bidding: Players bid for the right to be the declarer. The highest bid wins.\n2. The Draw: The declarer takes any 3 cards from the 6-card blind and discards 3 non-scoring cards (Leere) in their place.\n3. Trick Play: Standard Tarock rules. Trumps (Tarocks) always win against suit cards. You MUST follow suit or play a trump if void.',
